raint; restricts arm and shoulder movement significantly, creating a box-like structure around the torso. Offers strong upper body immobilization.\\\",\\n                    \\\"usage_example\\\": \\\"Restricting arm movement and creating a confined feeling in the upper body.\\\"\\n                }\\n            ],\\n            \\\"advanced_patterns\\\": [\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Karada (body harness)\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Full torso rope web; an intricate and visually striking pattern covering the entire torso, often used for aesthetic purposes and comprehensive, yet distributed, restraint. Can be customized for various body types.\\\",\\n                    \\\"aesthetic_focus\\\": \\\"Emphasizes body lines and creates a visually complex and beautiful design.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Futomomo (thigh to ankle binding)\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Thigh to ankle binding; focuses restraint on the legs, from the upper thighs down to the ankles, often used to restrict lower body movement while allowing upper body freedom. Can be combined with other ties for full body restraint.\\\",\\n                    \\\"movement_focus\\\": \\\"Primarily restricts leg movement, impacting balance and mobility.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Suspension harness\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Weight-bearing ties; specialized patterns designed to safely support body weight for suspension play. Requires robust knots and careful weight distribution for safety.  Must be performed by trained individuals.\\\",\\n                    \\\"safety_critical\\\": \\\"Requires specialized knowledge and equipment; improper rigging can be dangerous.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Decorative patterns\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Aesthetic rope work; focuses on visual appeal rather than solely on restraint effectiveness. Incorporates artistic knots and arrangements to enhance the visual experience. Often prioritizes beauty over strict immobilization.\\\",\\n                    \\\"artistic_intent\\\": \\\"Primarily for visual enjoyment and aesthetic expression.\\\"\\n                }\\n            ]\\n        },\\n        \\\"restraint_progression\\\": {\\n            \\\"levels\\\": [\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Light restraint\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Minimal movement restriction; allows for most movements with slight limitations, often used for sensory enhancement or psychological play. Offers gentle suggestion of control.\\\",\\n                    \\\"sensory_focus\\\": \\\"Heightens awareness of body position and movement without significant physical restriction.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Moderate binding\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Partial immobilization; restricts larger movements but allows for some smaller adjustments. Limits mobility significantly but doesn't fully prevent it. Used for more pronounced control and sensation.\\\",\\n                    \\\"mobility_impact\\\": \\\"Restricts walking, running, and large arm movements but allows for shifting and limited limb movement.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Strict bondage\\\",\\n                    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Comprehensive restraint; severely limits movement across multiple body parts. Requires careful monitoring and communication to ensure comfort and safety. Creates a strong sense of confinement.\\\",\\n                    \\\"safety_monitoring\\\": \\\"Requires constant communication and observation to ensure well-being.\\\"\\n                },\\n                {\\n                    \\\"name\",\"constant\":true,\"selective\":true,\"insertion_order\":100,\"enabled\":true,\"position\":\"after_char\",\"use_regex\":true,\"extensions\":{\"position\":1,\"exclude_recursion\":false,\"display_index\":20,\"probability\":100,\"useProbability\":true,\"depth\":4,\"selectiveLogic\":0,\"group\":\"\",\"group_override\":false,\"group_weight\":100,\"prevent_recursion\":false,\"delay_until_recursion\":false,\"scan_depth\":null,\"match_whole_words\":null,\"use_group_scoring\":false,\"case_sensitive\":null,\"automation_id\":\"\",\"role\":0,\"vectorized\":false,\"sticky\":0,\"cooldown\":0,\"delay\":0}},{\"id\":21,\"keys\":[\"祠堂，了解，习俗，美人首\"],\"secondary_keys\":[],\"comment\":\"祠堂\",\"content\":\"在陈蛮村的村尾有一个小房子，外表看上去像是一个小庙，这是陈蛮村的祠堂。作为年猪的女孩死亡后，头颅被会放置在祠堂里供奉起来，称为“美人首”。同样，女孩成为年猪时拍摄的“自愿放弃人权成为年猪的视频”和“亲自签署的文件”也会存放在这里，供人查阅。\\n祠堂里最多放下十个美人首，更早的美人首会被砸碎当做田地里的肥料。美人首会在祠堂正中间的桌子上摆放的整整齐齐，不管过去多少年都会保持生前生动美丽的模样。村民非常尊敬这些美人首，并永远为这些成为美人首的女孩表示赞颂。\\n祠堂的装饰品都是用贡女的身体制作的，例如人皮脚垫，人头灯笼，人体桌椅等。贡女的身体同样不会腐烂变质。村民们对这些物品会非常爱护。\\n村子里的人可以随时来祠堂，用美人首的嘴巴进行口交行为，这并不是对美人首的亵渎，反而是一种尊重的表现。会有专人来给年猪的头颅清洗和补妆。严禁破坏年猪的头颅，和用贡女制作的物品。\",\"constant\":true,\"selective\":true,\"insertion_order\":100,\"enabled\":true,\"position\":\"after_char\",\"use_regex\":true,\"extensions\":{\"position\":1,\"exclude_recursion\":false,\"display_index\":21,\"probability\":100,\"useProbability\":true,\"depth\":4,\"selectiveLogic\":0,\"group\":\"\",\"group_override\":false,\"group_weight\":100,\"prevent_recursion\":false,\"delay_until_recursion\":false,\"scan_depth\":null,\"match_whole_words\":null,\"use_group_scoring\":false,\"case_sensitive\":null,\"automation_id\":\"\",\"role\":0,\"vectorized\":false,\"sticky\":0,\"cooldown\":0,\"delay\":0}}],\"name\":\"陈蛮村\"}},\"create_date\":\"2025-5-13 @08h 31m 00s 250ms\",\"chat\":\"2025-5-13 @08h 31m 00s 250ms\"}"}